cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use LumiBot in research or a publication, please cite it as below."
title: LumiBot
type: software
abstract: >-
  LumiBot is an open-source Python framework for algorithmic and AI-agent
  trading. The same strategy code runs historical backtests, paper trading and
  live trading across stocks, options, futures, forex, crypto and prediction
  markets.
authors:
  - given-names: Robert
    family-names: Grzesik
  - name: Lumiwealth
repository-code: https://github.com/Lumiwealth/lumibot
url: https://lumibot.lumiwealth.com/
license: GPL-3.0
keywords:
  - algorithmic trading
  - backtesting
  - AI agents
  - quantitative finance
  - Python
